#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:367
#: 35418dd6f7f642faac4ed9ba26b9b5f6
msgid "Simulating Multiple Flight Controllers on a Vehicle"
msgstr "在飞行器上仿真多个飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:369
#: 948b4308055944db86663601daa18339
msgid ""
"The STANDBY Mode function (``RCx_OPTION`` = 76) allows an autopilot to be "
"put into a soft standby mode so that a second autopilot or companion "
"computer can take control, but allow the first to resume later. In order to "
"help in the code development of such systems, you can simulate two flight "
"controllers operating in the simulation at the same time. The \"master\" "
"instance, which has the active outputs into the sim is started declaring "
"that there will be a \"slave\" instance which will be monitoring the sensors"
" and running its code in parallel, but whose outputs are not connected into "
"the simulation physics:"
msgstr ""
"待机模式功能（``RCx_OPTION`` = "
"76）允许将自动驾驶仪置于软待机模式，以便第二个自动驾驶仪或伴飞计算机接管控制，同时允许第一个稍后恢复。为了协助此类系统的代码开发，您可以在仿真中同时模拟两个飞控运行。「主」实例具有向仿真输出的活动输出，在声明有「从」实例存在的情况下启动，从实例将并行监控传感器并运行其代码，但其输出未连接到仿真物理引擎："

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:375
#: 11e7f7f3bebd4e16ab7239ecde637070
msgid "then another sim is started for the \"slave\" autopilot using:"
msgstr "然后使用以下命令为「从」自动驾驶仪启动另一个仿真："

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:381
#: 1f6f43a486494ba5969ba0f612926c0c
msgid ""
"you can then switch between whose outputs are being used by the simulation "
"physics with the ``SIM_JSON_MASTER`` parameter  ie O or 1."
msgstr "然后您可以使用 ``SIM_JSON_MASTER`` 参数（即 0 或 1）切换仿真物理引擎使用哪个实例的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:383
#: 3c78038d98de44ee940aac6637519be7
msgid ""
"The second simulation could be running code from a different branch on the "
"same computer."
msgstr "第二个仿真可以在同一台计算机上运行来自不同分支的代码。"

